# 行尾统一：文本一律 LF 入库并 LF 检出，二进制靠 git 自动检测 + 下方显式 binary 兜底。
# 目的：Windows 与 macOS 之间切换开发时不再产生 LF/CRLF 假 diff。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 图片（binary = -text -diff -merge：不做换行转换、不尝试文本 diff）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary

# 字体
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary

# 数据库与本地存储
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.db-journal binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary

# 归档 / 二进制产物
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.pdf binary
*.wasm binary
*.bin binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.node binary

# 音视频 / 设计源文件
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.psd binary
*.ai binary
